  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Adds protocol-aware TOON HTTP requests and responses.\n- Adds body-version metadata and enum-based response-version requests\n- Adds response version validation and preserves hints for fallback and lazy error decoding\n- Breaking: defaults outbound encoding to official 4.4; select CustomLegacy for previous wire behavior\n- Breaking: changes the response Indent override from bool? to int? to transmit an integer width\n- Improves response option reuse and UTF-8 validation without changing HTTP completion policy\n- Updates runtime and contracts dependencies to DevOp.Toon 0.3.0 and DevOp.Toon.Core 0.2.0",
